    "notes": "<p><i>This dragon is a creature of pure darkness, its body composed of swirling shadows and cosmic dust. Its eyes glow with a malevolent purple light, and its scales shimmer with the colors of a dying star.</i></p><p><strong>Movement:</strong> DOUBLE NEAR (fly + starglide)</p>",
